1055	84733	email	2026-07-03 23:12:28.702869	1	Hi John,\n\nThat's great that you want to play soccer for Lighthouse Men's Soccer Club 1893!\n\nHere's the full program description:\n\nLighthouse 1893 is the oldest nonprofit community organization in Philadelphia, serving the neighborhood for over 133 years.\n\nMEMBERSHIP:\nYour membership runs year-round and covers all four seasons (Winter, Spring, Summer, Fall), training, matches, tournaments, and your uniform. There are no per-season, per-tournament, indoor, or uniform fees.\n\nSCHEDULE:\n  • 𝗡𝗲𝘅𝘁 𝗽𝗿𝗮𝗰𝘁𝗶𝗰𝗲: Fri, Jul 3\n  • Practice: Tuesday through Friday 7:00–8:30pm, Saturday 11:00am–12:30pm. Players are expected to attend 2 sessions per week.\n  • Games: Sundays\n  • Home Outdoor Facility: Lighthouse Sports Complex, 199 E Erie Avenue, Philadelphia PA 19140\n  • Home Indoor Facility: Lighthouse Community Center, 141 W Somerset Street, Philadelphia PA 19133\n\nBILLING:\nRegistration is $1 at signup. Membership is $35/month, charged on the first Friday of each month.\n\nIf you sign up mid-month, your first partial month is prorated at $8.75 per week, charged each Friday until the first Friday of the following month, when the $35/month cadence begins.\n\nPayment cards saved at registration are charged automatically through LeagueApps. A receipt is emailed for each charge. Members can pause or cancel anytime.\n\nCHANGES & QUESTIONS:\nTo pause or cancel a membership, or ask a question, email soccer@lighthouse1893.org.\n\nTo register, head here: https://lighthouse1893.leagueapps.com/leagues/soccer-(outdoor)/5039300-lighthouse-1893-mens-club-soccer-membership\n\nReply with any other questions — or if it's easier, let me know a good time to call.	sent	more-info
